# Only the generated filler is ignored here. Decision reversed 2026-09-05.
#
# The fourteen archive fixtures in this directory were built BY HAND in WinRAR
# and 7-Zip on 2026-08-27 and cannot be regenerated by anything in this repo.
# They are the only evidence behind three commits' worth of archive claims, and
# while they were ignored a fresh clone silently had none of them, which made
# every one of those claims unrepeatable. They are ~12 MB and now committed.
#
# The ten ENCRYPTED ones were rebuilt 2026-09-30 with the password
# "right-one": the original password was never recorded, so they could not be
# opened. archive-wasm.test.mjs uses them; the recipe is in the vault note
# "Archive Size Limits".
#
# pup-zip64.zip stays out: it is ~9 MB of 70,000 one-byte entries that exists
# only to force the ZIP64 path, and tests/make-fixtures.mjs rebuilds it
# deterministically in seconds. Storing filler in git buys nothing.
pup-zip64.zip
